{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa7.u06",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa7.u06",
  "version": 1,
  "content_hash": "9d1019e4fc59ab8848673eecadcc9a7fae66d51adabdce5312fff18a6d446390",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u06.l01",
      "sha256": "be9bf8c7e2f32220461c34d7b8568cc21c01a2bd3386e12cd0d86152dc0e0888"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u06.l02",
      "sha256": "ac602a83085ca8d94861527e9cb41cfacc031fd5b3965f5b1025919b7ca92d0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u06.l03",
      "sha256": "0624e839049f47341d1a4117bc56fd1cb314dad9f036d5056ca6d4e6cd59fa25"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u06.l04",
      "sha256": "80ee2dffc9e278b15d43c80e97a3e3a46d5b1b6424ada78d69cd736126e57f33"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u06.l05",
      "sha256": "ab380dd9203d6938dff4f680bb0b7c7fc97670954fc0087ad6fcaa256febc166"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa7.u06.l06",
      "sha256": "addce7c90d4ae244515392d5762428d3187d2fb89f9a4b0d17407dce6634a8e9"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "039a9a53da5fbe7214cd8d78eb8a25ae28d9472d00b1fed3dd9f77c34529f5ea",
      "text": "privasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "04efdd737591ab56d8005f14564555089f640169cd9667448d36dfca31beb92e",
      "text": "Ayo kita cek fakta. Mulai dari sumber resmi, situs Dinas Kelautan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "052206094f5cbc4a6be226e827c459fcfbb2e05ea058bb170061e957a1de0d5a",
      "text": "Lihat pesan ini. Sudah dibagikan ke dua puluh grup sejak tadi pagi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "06b7d6730576a75c5ff00554fc15da0664b4f61a1ab68b4a8f0714cd18257505",
      "text": "Ayo cek fakta. Para peneliti hanya memperkirakan ribuan tahun, dan mereka masih berhati-hati.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 93,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b6d44796fa7ca63284c4e592f564f5db4f0d379d41cc275e575b171110402d2",
      "text": "Unggahan tentang larangan memancing itu sudah viral. Tulis beritanya, ya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b995f0377b53f55927ababe74a16bbd8d496f4f5ebee4e09ad58e92d4be1853",
      "text": "Lihat tebing itu. Ada lukisan tangan merah yang sudah sangat tua.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f2db9542750fa7e06203aed146dd516008725c9f96a7b51ba874426e37b2349",
      "text": "Menurut saya, kuncinya bukan larangan, tetapi literasi digital.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "11e99827eb724897aa10e0a5130b68a69c7d78a4c5c03f044e56e0629568fba1",
      "text": "Terima kasih. Kami tidak menolak manfaatnya, tetapi dampak negatifnya nyata, yaitu kecanduan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 93,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1286a6c9f3a11cede0fdd5858ebd3eb7ce9872414bcab6ba6eff45d6feed8a05",
      "text": "Hoaks itu menyebar cepat karena banyak orang tidak tahu cara cek fakta.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 71,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "14497bc979b97e6a61b2274fe2ffdb08da491fbbed01369b22fba2cb288138e8",
      "text": "antonim",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1bcd60533fd3c30ec6e02869cd09c0c6637e53088d46629b91de4456de752ff9",
      "text": "Wartawan yang objektif memisahkan fakta dari opini.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1f459beedfc1e5e780eb54be96d02f120e50bfcd4bd6c29a7a1bcf290aa59b24",
      "text": "kredibel",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "22beeda499a69c438fb2591057d3b251b90d173776692ff699cdd5d22051a5d0",
      "text": "Tulisanmu memakai kata \"hoaks\" tujuh kali. Coba ganti dengan sinonim.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2534ccb190d6cd5748a831fc7c3f90c460e327001cec1d7547503295ef6b8698",
      "text": "Kalau begitu, besok kita cek faktanya bersama-sama.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2abf93cbb865fa35f570f8ccd89b611113ad311b5298201c06961b466a028378",
      "text": "kolokasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2f7d347dbd4acb6c4c277bb03371b6e9f7b4af42323977dbca3b72a13c8fb2dd",
      "text": "unggahan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3968c62081cc0f95bb7867a09d01da905e7d3926940cf6a9c632e769422644fa",
      "text": "Verifikasi membutuhkan dua sumber yang kredibel.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "42f0cb1b50caac2a0af8dda3abec7113b6e484e095a9141b744d8145dffd9cf8",
      "text": "Radio Kaka Yohana di Sorong juga memberitakan hal yang sama. Jadi, itu hoaks.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 77,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "438227de39197c9ca80755e117192369bb17f41d0866464fe2b44a938c5d8da2",
      "text": "Hiponim dan sinonim membantu kita menghindari pengulangan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4cae78e9c117f261eef18bc5ad79621151a99ca88a5da8d4103fb7023c1ed49c",
      "text": "Dan nelayan? Berita yang objektif harus mendengar kedua belah pihak.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4e607e8bb5c8b28e9cffaef543ea80b9605c3189d06849570df69fbd342ee48a",
      "text": "Jadi unggahan itu menyesatkan. Terima kasih, Kak. Besok saya berangkat ke Manokwari.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 84,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "669d9f8c6956a895d67cb8e0778b742d94e4ed6474081a965b9c152805cd50f8",
      "text": "Unggahan itu dibagikan lebih dari sepuluh ribu kali dalam sehari.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "66b74635a373b43e7583a7f760f16e439268636a95e2a7850e49e34db2a66054",
      "text": "Setelah mendengar kedua belah pihak, ia menulis laporan yang objektif.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "696c566bd41a51622aa61e4b5c4a8f245d166e3859a7c8046a85f79a1467209c",
      "text": "Dan antonimnya, \"fakta\", saya taruh di kalimat terakhir.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6acf2340072940bfe0a9f38b733738e212509816e2a8334bebbae7a807b90cb2",
      "text": "Argumen yang seimbang. Apa solusinya?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 37,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6c18da10aa87893a35ca54b55e2c3c3b6fbfaff1a01b62b08951acecb8c863c2",
      "text": "sinonim",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6f89c5f431d88ed9a1af774359a8f6758d3d8786b181293bf4741b38aa6e02cb",
      "text": "sumber resmi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6fb8d5e2edd4279c2734b206beecae528d5f850d9a09f84a228e9a64f6b49d19",
      "text": "menyesatkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "733dc50bb1d1415e9114f261b03968853b1c6c78b5b50bdd9dfef93a17a898f0",
      "text": "Tim cek fakta melakukan verifikasi dengan sumber resmi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "768f4c1c5fb918893afbbd62cf6481e208f78528b5149a94a6426c8a3adbec01",
      "text": "berita palsu",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7a0d03e464bd056ef27c1a64e209450c934b3586149d5be3edf2b0820961fc31",
      "text": "Berita bohong, kabar palsu… Tapi di judul saya ulang \"hoaks\" dengan sengaja.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7ab93a5a7f08ae985ceed4bfc9f2657e4b6e97ac937dc2e0f75394f5cb47ebf2",
      "text": "Selain itu, privasi anak-anak sering bocor tanpa mereka sadari.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7c194b351e788661c5f0fa320ccbc09fd0a6e387607b48e3dbd834885814894a",
      "text": "Itu boleh. Repetisi yang disengaja justru menegaskan pesanmu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7fdaf99e7e8a97d682e852117c1b01bada6ffbe02f26ed3dd64897ee3fde0778",
      "text": "Hoaks tentang laut beracun membuat nelayan kehilangan pembeli.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "83eb6455b4b083fcb8de2ebac9b688e68dee6f805b1ccbcad84c996087496615",
      "text": "hoaks",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "880cdd4db651065c7607cb95832fe35b58eff7ebe1e133e9cc66ce95c7208d4b",
      "text": "literasi digital",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 16,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8dd401602841b71903ccb4154f0c7e41a71d6e629d4aae3d758e11b4eef36420",
      "text": "Opini harus dipisahkan dari fakta dalam berita yang objektif.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "924f86aa3e00e0f14f3b9ec4084764269b3a3563930196dd3847fcf09670c51c",
      "text": "Besok pagi saya wawancara mereka. Opini saya sendiri tidak saya masukkan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "954b4486ff5e714d4f03846d12d310c4c48e718e7aeec8e2009a46d5ff35d8ea",
      "text": "Judul berita itu provokatif dan isinya menyesatkan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9569d8d68bb592e80f9e4c2619c4a878e2f87a1bf530b89c85ee26d6496e639d",
      "text": "Tim pro sudah bicara. Sekarang giliran tim kontra, Mohamed.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9a5fdb2a94222cfafb40695166cb8431af4a56e4990222770dc6f97f6f39add8",
      "text": "Ada siaran pers pagi ini. Mereka bilang airnya aman.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9b47ce6999b357f3dcbdb6dfb1638063a670a6779c36fc5a84c848a185401d49",
      "text": "Hasil cek fakta menunjukkan bahwa tangkapan layar itu palsu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9e2b81af344a9e9eec08bb110aea88a259a66d87d95039d3195f28f09c6a6d88",
      "text": "dampak negatif",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a0df25a0ec2b9158e534f57720d4d4eab8ff628a589c35a1c412860e7cc2fd4f",
      "text": "Repetisi dan antonim membuat pidato lebih kuat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a3ed49a659ff108d0e0beedf66971d9df033e89377eb83bad504f042d7c46075",
      "text": "Tim cek fakta menemukan bahwa kabar itu hoaks.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a46d00dcc9dc202a9433d48b46bf58cf6a1e245057bb95896b9538fdbb2e6dbd",
      "text": "hiponim",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a73e41e5c6d183a8b2010eb463dcb6c4392c77d15eac810c7e6e77b6e1bddf49",
      "text": "Kolokasi seperti \"mengunggah foto\" terdengar alami bagi penutur asli.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a89250ce63e1e1df7f7af2e6f81cf218746d16136590ac740b35328ef0f36cc2",
      "text": "Unggahan yang provokatif itu ternyata berita palsu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "af1405c2708aca5c85bea4074003070a0836498469ec24142de0c05cf8cb89a8",
      "text": "Unggahan itu memuat opini, bukan fakta.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b613e9f0b3261d191ff7663abc1a1a6ca0778111a4815b8bfd49ccf6ccd92468",
      "text": "Saya tidak mau menyebarkan berita palsu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b8b92f23e8a1039e404da4b3906a75bfcea07c93e89f0723926963bdab253d4f",
      "text": "Literasi digital melindungi privasi kita dan keluarga kita.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ba714ecd618c8eef15ce9bf14bad06f5c2bff477b03a220c2502d7483a3ecb0e",
      "text": "Di internet ada unggahan yang bilang umurnya satu juta tahun. Itu benar?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 72,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bc3b0025d5c4c666d34fdabfce9fb5993a2cdce8fd1309fea094385f5e3e1bf4",
      "text": "Kecanduan media sosial bisa mengganggu tidur.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c19654351f52a1d25ec63b7441252985e2e7d0df391908b6933281d8bae2cb89",
      "text": "Kata \"menyebarkan\" sering berkolokasi dengan kata \"hoaks\".",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 58,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c5c8dfe0b1ac33f78c0c6f20a8098abf15f119d65652ce9687d30c66243b3ad9",
      "text": "Bocornya privasi adalah dampak negatif yang sering diabaikan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c6d149ceee64b44c4b946cfb548120c1c70bc1594ee2a7bc3ad531192017533e",
      "text": "verifikasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cbac4a49b7bf878d64523d62879f6dc9680f69f386c2b9798d52ee23370e3fd4",
      "text": "Bagus. Sekarang verifikasi dengan satu media lain yang kredibel.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd0f9457ebf79bb342a1918ea0f9e41e1cb367f13f8f633e1aa34b7c930696c4",
      "text": "Judulnya provokatif sekali, dan sumbernya cuma \"teman\".",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d4c4147315903a32d3ecb71dc9d5daf1908e2400d6ef88b9b22fcdaaddd77867",
      "text": "Judul yang provokatif sering dipakai untuk menarik klik.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d922d33e82e2ecb89a1e91dd35ca2a77cef0e8139594c34f9b6a927617bd45ad",
      "text": "provokatif",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d922dd71cb277fd526a58587c1412addb851b72db166228bcd992b8200f10009",
      "text": "Betul. Para nelayan sudah panik. Hoaks seperti ini menyesatkan banyak orang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e8ec16e02c471d846d4d272c2daaf61d82d717631a65708a14c421b8971a6566",
      "text": "menyebarkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e96a1f1f82f2bf1393529198e83f150ba60aa442d73e7f3391a08aee29f0c870",
      "text": "Saya sudah bicara dengan kepala kampung. Menurut beliau, larangan itu hanya sementara.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 86,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "eb66243781b81be1f718c9eafc01b94bd1dc4d64d9ff541b24ecb963fb4a24a8",
      "text": "Literasi digital, sejak sekolah dasar.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 38,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee866332ef67662f9076fb6ca6595303a03e6b1a95ba3f2e33749ad3e459aa1e",
      "text": "kecanduan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f2ab484d23f692d79076ef8f2c27c7ba378b0f22da25b5e75921a84c0064bb58",
      "text": "objektif",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f4087ad5acc19f27519f35d715c98caa1046b481ed3aaddb0f660f373c0fc3b0",
      "text": "opini",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f4487ce8d918ec63d553383fc0ccc68db0a7bea65200a2f508790444288f9753",
      "text": "Media yang kredibel selalu menyebutkan sumbernya dengan jelas.",
